                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="group of reindeer, more than three hundred, strayed off and were lost. Then"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-142_l8" HPOS="535" VPOS="878" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="535 921 2303 921" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="535 921 535 932 2301 934 2303 921 2301 884 2198 889 2178 878 2176 878 2174 878 2172 878 2171 878 2130 887 2042 878 2040 878 2038 878 2036 878 2019 891 1835 891 1818 878 1816 878 1814 878 1812 878 1765 887 1742 878 1740 878 1738 878 1668 889 1648 878 1646 878 1644 878 1642 878 1640 878 1613 887 1582 878 1580 878 1578 878 1512 889 1465 878 1463 878 1461 878 1459 878 1420 889 1348 878 1346 878 1344 878 1299 889 1065 878 1064 878 1062 878 1019 889 972 878 970 878 968 878 966 878 964 878 943 891 882 891 834 878 832 878 830 878 828 878 826 878 808 891 535 891 535 921"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="news came from the Oloi River that the reindeer had gone to Eiˊheli, and"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-142_l9" HPOS="537" VPOS="944" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="537 979 2303 979" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="537 979 537 993 2299 1000 2303 979 2301 950 537 944 537 979"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="had been appropriated by him. After that, every time they met at the spring"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-142_l10" HPOS="535" VPOS="1000" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="53" BASELINE="537 1036 2303 1039" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="537 1036 535 1049 2299 1053 2303 1039 2299 1000 537 1002 537 1036"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="fair, Čêpaˊt asked Eiˊheli about his reindeer, but Eiˊheli most stoutly denied"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-142_l11" HPOS="535" VPOS="1057" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="537 1100 2305 1096" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="537 1100 537 1115 2303 1115 2305 1096 2301 1069 2211 1057 2210 1057 2208 1057 2182 1067 2151 1057 2149 1057 2147 1057 2145 1057 2124 1067 2087 1057 2085 1057 2083 1057 2081 1057 2044 1069 1882 1069 1867 1057 1865 1057 1863 1057 1861 1057 1859 1057 1826 1067 1790 1057 1789 1057 1787 1057 1716 1067 1644 1057 1642 1057 1596 1067 1401 1059 1399 1059 1397 1059 1395 1059 1381 1069 1340 1059 1338 1059 1336 1059 1334 1059 1295 1069 1175 1059 1173 1059 1079 1069 999 1059 997 1059 535 1063 537 1100"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="having any knowledge of them. In the year 1895, Čêpaˊt even talked about"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-142_l12" HPOS="535" VPOS="1115" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="537 1160 2303 1156" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="537 1160 537 1172 2301 1168 2303 1156 2301 1127 2284 1115 2282 1115 2280 1115 2278 1115 2219 1129 2159 1129 2139 1115 2137 1115 2135 1115 2134 1115 2071 1129 1937 1129 1919 1115 1917 1115 1915 1115 1913 1115 1911 1115 1886 1129 1726 1129 1707 1115 1705 1115 1703 1115 1701 1115 1642 1129 1578 1129 1559 1115 1557 1115 1555 1115 1553 1115 1551 1115 1514 1125 1498 1115 1496 1115 1494 1115 1492 1115 1385 1117 1383 1117 1356 1131 1188 1131 1151 1117 1149 1117 1147 1117 1145 1117 1114 1129 1040 1117 1038 1117 929 1127 892 1117 890 1117 888 1117 886 1117 857 1129 773 1117 771 1117 535 1123 537 1160"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="his intention of robbing the camp of Eiˊheli on his return home. Then fol-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-142_l13" HPOS="537" VPOS="1178" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="537 1219 2303 1219" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
